# Hostnames whose TLS ClientHello ByeDPI splits (one per line). Matching is on
# label boundaries against the SNI / Host header: "discord.com" also covers
# "cdn.discord.com" but not "notdiscord.com". Every other connection is relayed
# byte-for-byte. The PAC server routes exactly these hosts through the proxy.
#
# Keep the list minimal and add a host only after confirming it is blocked:
# splitting can break servers that cannot reassemble a split ClientHello.
# Lines starting with "#" and blank lines are ignored. Edit and redeploy.

# Discord (TR SNI-based block; confirmed bypassed with --tlsrec=1+s)
discord.com
discord.gg
discordapp.com
discordapp.net
discord.media
